MAX SALTONSTALL: With almost
500 sessions of Next 2018,

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.950
it's understandable that you
couldn't get to them all.

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.690
So if you didn't see
Don't Get Phished--

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:08.787
Authentication Best
Practices, then stay tuned,

00:00:08.787 --> 00:00:09.870
because here's the rewind.

00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:11.798
